orgeous and immersive Sicilian-inspired seaside scenery.<br></li><li>A heartwarming and family-centric story.<br></li><li>A whirling and magical original soundtrack.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/extras/3106d2e95ecf8a5fe0c5c166c5579aa6.avif?t=1724655623\" width=640 height=201 /></span>", "short_description": "Welcome to the magical world of Sorelle: a whimsical 3D puzzle-platformer that immerses you in the magical seaside town of Isola Chiara. Play as sisters Alessandra, Bella, and Capri as you explore the magic of sisterhood in a puzzle-solving adventure to restore magic and save the summer festival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/header.jpg?t=1724655623", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1724655623", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1724655623", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4690 / AMD FX-8350 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 770 / Radeon R9 280X or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 13.5<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel x64<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 770 / Radeon R9 280X / Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>